#. i18n: file nvidia3dwidget.ui line 290
#: rc.cpp:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synchronise to vertical retrace"
msgstr "Sincronizar co trazamento vertical"

#. i18n: file nvidia3dwidget.ui line 295
#: rc.cpp:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option prevents \"tearing\" artifacts at the expense of lower "
"performance.\n"
"\n"
"When enabled, OpenGL applications will swap buffers during the vertical "
"retrace; this option is applied to OpenGL applications that are started after "
"this option is set."
msgstr ""
"Esta opzón evita os efeitos de \"desgarrado\" co custo dun rendimento menor.\n"
"\n"
"Cando estexa activa, as aplicazóns OpenGL trocarán de buffers durante o período "
"de refresco vertical; esta opzón aplica-se nos programas OpenGL que son "
"iniciados após a alterazón desta opzón."

